function monthsOf(key){const [a,b]=rangeOf(key);const out=[];let d=new Date(dparse(a).getFullYear(),dparse(a).getMonth(),1);const end=dparse(b);while(d<=end){out.push(iso(d));d=new Date(d.getFullYear(),d.getMonth()+1,1)}return out}
function moveMonth(n){const ms=monthsOf(prefs.sem);monthIndex=Math.max(0,Math.min(ms.length-1,monthIndex+n));render()}
function renderMonth(){
  const ms=monthsOf(prefs.sem);monthIndex=Math.max(0,Math.min(monthIndex,ms.length-1));const m0=ms[monthIndex],md=dparse(m0);
  {const mt=md.toLocaleDateString('es-ES',{month:'long',year:'numeric'});$('monthTitle').textContent=mt.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+mt.slice(1)}
  const start=mondayOf(m0),t=todayIso(),[ra,rb]=rangeOf(prefs.sem);
  let html=['Lun','Mar','Mié','Jue','Vie','Sáb','Dom'].map(x=>`<div class="mh">${x}</div>`).join('');
  const last=iso(new Date(md.getFullYear(),md.getMonth()+1,0));const endW=addDays(mondayOf(last),6);
  const hs=hitosIn(start,endW);
  for(let d=start;d<=endW;d=addDays(d,7)){
    const w={start:d,end:addDays(d,6)},evs=buildWeek(w).filter(visible);
    for(let i=0;i<7;i++){const day=addDays(d,i),x=DATA.holidays[day],out=dparse(day).getMonth()!==md.getMonth();
      const de=evs.filter(e=>e.date===day&&e.kind!=='personal');
      const cnt={ufv:de.filter(e=>cls(e)==='ufv').length,esic:de.filter(e=>cls(e)==='esic').length,meeting:de.filter(e=>cls(e)==='meeting').length};
      const ex=periodsIn(day,day).filter(p=>p.kind==='exam');
      const kh=hs.filter(k=>k.date===day);
      html+=`<div class="mc${out?' out':''}${i>4?' we':''}${x?' hol':''}${day===t?' today':''}" onclick="openDay('${day}')" title="${ex.map(p=>h(p.name)).join(' · ')}">${ex.length?'<span class="exb"></span>':''}<div class="top"><span class="d">${dparse(day).getDate()}</span>${day>=ra&&day<=rb?`<button type="button" class="add" aria-label="Añadir fecha clave el ${dLong(day)}" onclick="event.stopPropagation();newHito(null,'${day}')">+</button>`:''}</div>${x?`<span class="holtag">${h(x.name)}</span>`:''}<div class="dots">${cnt.ufv?`<span class="ufv">UFV ${cnt.ufv}</span>`:''}${cnt.esic?`<span class="esic">ESIC ${cnt.esic}</span>`:''}${cnt.meeting?`<span class="meeting">Reun.</span>`:''}</div><div class="chips" style="display:grid;gap:3px">${kh.slice(0,3).map(k=>`<button type="button" class="kchip k-${k.type}${k.done?' done':''}" onclick="event.stopPropagation();openHito('${k.id}','${k.date}')"><span>${h(k.title)}</span></button>`).join('')}${kh.length>3?`<span class="more">+${kh.length-3} más</span>`:''}</div></div>`}
  }
  $('monthGrid').innerHTML=html;
}
